# {{ title }}

{{ description }}

A PICO-8 game. The cart is `pico8/{{ game }}.p8`; its code is in the
`#include`d `pico8/*.lua` files.

## Play

```sh
make pico8          # in PICO-8 (needs PICO-8 installed)
make fetch-lovejs   # once: download the love.js runtime
make serve          # in the browser, on the LÖVE preview player
```

Controls: arrow keys to walk, Z/C/N (🅾️) to start.

## Develop

```sh
make test           # unit tests, cart smoke test, token budget, sound check
make music          # compile tools/scores.lua into the cart
make screenshots    # refresh docs/screenshots/ and the cart label (needs LÖVE)
```

The toolchain comes from
[geyser-pico8-template](https://github.com/koaning/geyser-pico8-template);
`copier update` pulls in its improvements. See AGENTS.md for how the pieces
fit together.
